      "summary_en": "Evelynn strikes out with her Lasher, dealing damage to the first unit hit. Then, Evelynn can shoot a line of spikes at nearby foes a few times.",
      "summary_zh": "伊芙琳用鞭子进行抽击，对命中的第一个敌方单位造成伤害。随后，伊芙琳可以朝附近的敌人发出一列尖刺，可发射若干次。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
